{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]If you confess with your mouth
That [Gm]Jesus Christ is [A]Lord
[Dm]And believe within your [F]heart
That [Bb]God has raised him [A]up
You will be [Dm]saved
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
The Lord is my strength and my song
[Bb]He has become my sal[F]va[C]tion
[Dm]Shouts of joy in the [F]tents of the [C]righteous
The [Gm]Lord's right hand does [A]valian[Dm]tly
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Everyone who calls on him
Will [Gm]never be put to [A]shame
[Dm]There is no Jew or [F]Greek
For [Bb]he is Lord of [A]all
Call on his [Dm]name
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

